{"id":939,"slug":"harpoon","name":"鱼叉","en":"Harpoon","cost":4700,"qual":"","category":"luxury","categoryLabel":"神装","neutralTier":null,"img":"assets/items/harpoon.png","desc":"<div class=\"tt-h\">主动：钩捕</div>对敌人使用时向其发射一支鱼叉，将自身和目标牵引到更近的位置，最多牵引自身与目标之间距离的35%。近战英雄总是将目标牵引至他们的攻击距离。以树木为目标总是会把自身牵引至该树木。\n\n<div class=\"tt-h\">被动：回音一击</div>近战攻击可以快速攻击两次。两次攻击都将减缓100%移动速度，第一次持续1秒。回音一击冷却时间：5秒","lore":"完美解决敌人逃跑的问题。","notes":[],"values":[{"key":"bonus_damage","label":"+攻击力","value":"25"},{"key":"bonus_strength","label":"+力量","value":"25"},{"key":"bonus_agility","label":"+敏捷","value":"10"},{"key":"bonus_intellect","label":"+智力","value":"10"},{"key":"bonus_mana_regen","label":"+魔法恢复","value":"2"},{"key":"movement_slow","label":"移动减速","value":"100%"},{"key":"slow_duration","label":"减速持续时间","value":"1 秒"},{"key":"max_distance","label":"最大距离","value":"1000"},{"key":"push_length","label":"推进距离","value":"600"},{"key":"projectile_speed","label":"弹道速度","value":"2000"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"19 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"50"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"700"}],"components":[{"slug":"echo_sabre","name":"回音战刃","cost":2700,"img":"assets/items/echo_sabre.png"},{"slug":"diadem","name":"宝冕","cost":1000,"img":"assets/items/diadem.png"}],"buildsInto":[],"short":"+攻击力 25 · +力量 25","aliases":[],"heroes":[{"slug":"dawnbreaker","name":"破晓辰星","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/dawnbreaker.png","count":61,"heat":100},{"slug":"tiny","name":"小小","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/tiny.png","count":45,"heat":73.77},{"slug":"sven","name":"斯温","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/sven.png","count":43,"heat":70.49},{"slug":"omniknight","name":"全能骑士","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/omniknight.png","count":39,"heat":63.93},{"slug":"magnataur","name":"马格纳斯","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/magnataur.png","count":24,"heat":39.34},{"slug":"monkey_king","name":"齐天大圣","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/monkey_king.png","count":20,"heat":32.79}]}